# `optim::optima_stall_category_name`

The name of an `OptimaStallCategory` as text.

## Signature

```cpp
std::string_view optim::optima_stall_category_name(optim::OptimaStallCategory category);
```

## What It Does

Returns a lower-case hyphenated name such as `none`, `iteration-limit` or `nonfinite-callback-region`.

## Parameters

`category`
: The category.

## Returns

A static name.

## Practical Examples

### Example 1

All eleven.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

using namespace pluss::tils;

namespace optim = pluss::subsp::math::optim;
using Pack = optim::ParameterPack<pluss::Series>;

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(4));
  for (int i = 0; i <= 10; ++i)
    out.writeln(i, "->", optim::optima_stall_category_name(static_cast<optim::OptimaStallCategory>(i)));
}
```

### Example 2

Naming the stall of a cut-short run.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

using namespace pluss::tils;

namespace optim = pluss::subsp::math::optim;
using Pack = optim::ParameterPack<pluss::Series>;

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(4));
  const pluss::Series target = pluss::series::make({1.0, 2.0});
  const auto objective = [&](const pluss::Series &x) { return (x - target).square().sum(); };
  const auto disc = optim::constraints().nl_ineq([](const Pack &p) { return p.at("x").square().sum() - 1.0; });

  optim::OptimaOptions options;
  options.sequential_qp.max_iterations = 1;
  const optim::OptimaState result = optim::optima(objective, pluss::series::make({0.0, 0.0}), options, disc);
  out.writeln("stall =", optim::optima_stall_category_name(result.output.stall_category));
}
```

### Example 3

From inside a progress hook, where every snapshot carries a category.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

using namespace pluss::tils;

namespace optim = pluss::subsp::math::optim;
using Pack = optim::ParameterPack<pluss::Series>;

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(4));
  const pluss::Series target = pluss::series::make({1.0, 2.0});
  const auto objective = [&](const pluss::Series &x) { return (x - target).square().sum(); };
  const auto disc = optim::constraints().nl_ineq([](const Pack &p) { return p.at("x").square().sum() - 1.0; });

  optim::OptimaOptions options;
  options.sequential_qp.progress_hook = [&out](const optim::OptimaProgressSnapshot &s) {
    if (s.stage == optim::OptimaProgressStage::Iteration) out.writeln("iteration", s.iteration, "stall:", optim::optima_stall_category_name(s.stall_category));
    return false;
  };
  const optim::OptimaState result = optim::optima(objective, pluss::series::make({0.0, 0.0}), options, disc);
}
```

